e('gradient','update','Update direction and amount use each parameter’s sensitivity.')
e('update','training','Learning requires an actual parameter change between successive calculations.')
e('accumulate','training','Combining examples requires adding their sensitivity contributions.')
e('reverse','target','The answer needs the mechanism that computes parameter sensitivities.')
